  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "When scaling an avatar via its root using AV3 (e.g a float/radial wheel controller that adjusts the root transform of the entire avatar), the shoulders do not scale correctly.\nThis affects some situations e.g Dreadriths clone system when using elbow/shoulder tracking.\nExpected behavior is the entire IK scaling 1:1 as it always has in the past. It is only the shoulders that do this, and disabling shoulder tracking makes everything perfect.\nVideo:\nhttps://youtu.be/Qx3PktsNM4A\nThank you for your time :)",
